@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/products/
Accept: application/json

###
### 1. Kullanıcı Girişi (Login) - Token Almak İçin
# @name login
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser_3127@godeva.com.tr",
    "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 2. Aktif Kullanıcı Detayları (GetMe)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Oturumu Kapatma (Logout)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Tüm Bildirimleri Listele
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Sadece Okunmamış Bildirimleri Listele
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications?onlyUnread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Tek Bir Bildirimi Okundu Yap (id değerini değiştirin)
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Tüm Bildirimleri Toplu Okundu Yap
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json